-cap financial services business with a $5.2B market cap on $29.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years and +3% annually across the full decade \u2014 essentially flat, and a business treading water is rarely a path to compounding.","Returns on capital run at 0% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 250.5\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 0.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 2.4\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.0) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Financial Services peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Financial Services peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 33% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Fannie Mae (OTCMKTS:FNMA) Shares Cross Below 50-Day Moving Average \u2013 Here\u2019s Why","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/11/fannie-mae-otcmktsfnma-shares-cross-below-50-day-moving-average-heres-why.html","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794393674.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.84,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Federal National Mortgage Association (FNMA) Following Q3 Earnings Faces A Fair Value Debate","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/otc-fnma/federal-national-mortgage-association/news/federal-national-mortgage-association-fnma-following-q3-earn","date":"2026-11-08","timestamp":1794130653.823,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.802,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Fannie Mae Announces Winner of Twenty-Ninth Community Impact Pool of Non-Performing Loans","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/fannie-mae-announces-winner-twenty-150000000.html","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794323716.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.875,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"VRMTG ACQ, LLC Wins Bid for Fannie Mae's 29th Community Impact Pool","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/vrmtg-acq-llc-wins-bid-for-fannie-maes-29th-community-impact-pool","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794323526.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.572,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"How Stronger Earnings Will Impact Fannie Mae Stock Investors","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/otc-fnma/federal-national-mortgage-association/news/how-